  "edge_schema": "voltmarkt_edge_sort",
  "prompt": "Sanne, the category manager, is planning a budget audio shelf and asks which headphones and earbuds could go on it, and at what price. From the products table, keep the headphones and earbuds (category_id 15 or 16) whose unit_cost_eur is under 40.00 euros; a product with a missing unit_cost_eur is left out. Return five columns, in this order: product_id, product_name, brand, unit_cost_eur and shelf_price_eur, the unit cost plus a 60 percent markup on it, so a product that costs 10.00 euros gets a shelf price of 16.00 euros. Do not round. Return one row per product. Sort by unit_cost_eur from lowest to highest; when products have the same unit_cost_eur, sort them by product_id from low to high.",
